{"id":18311,"name":"Shiawassee County","slug":"shiawassee-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/shiawassee-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:43","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","typicalSaleDate":"Held twice a year, in August and October","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 hold on a credit card","extra":[{"label":"Payment Methods","value":"Wire transfer, certified check, or credit/debit card (2.75% fee for card payments)"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"www.tax-sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Shiawassee Official County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"W4Y2E8iiPmptAgCxlFcTaU20ulM1k6hYq5nrJqWfPr6XjRZtkg3oDeKVKHvVSTM5OwSBupzN1nm7OhIbIL9c78xs4QGdaXQdHfb\"><iframe title=\"How About Landing a Property at 40-90% Off? - Shiawassee County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wEMNzlydvNo?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-About-Landing-a-Property-at-40-90%-Off?---Shiawassee-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Landing a Property at 40-90% Off in Shiawassee County, Michigan</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ever thought about buying property at a fraction of its market value? In Shiawassee County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan</mark></a>, you can score properties at tax foreclosure auctions with discounts ranging from 40% to 90%! This is a fantastic way to get into real estate investing with a relatively low entry cost.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-understanding-tax-lien-certificates-and-tax-deeds\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates and Tax Deeds</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>When you buy a tax deed in Shiawassee County, you are purchasing the property outright. This differs from tax liens, where you essentially buy the debt, and the property owner has to pay you back with interest. Here’s how the process typically works:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Tax Deed:</strong> You win the auction and get the property, usually free and clear of most liens.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Potential Returns:</strong> Depending on the property and the bid, returns can be substantial, especially if you buy at a significant discount.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-to-start-tax-deed-investing-in-shiawassee-county\">How to Start Tax Deed Investing in Shiawassee County?</h2>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Local Laws</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Understanding the legal framework is crucial. Each county might have different rules and procedures.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Shiawassee County Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://shiawassee.net/county-treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Shiawassee County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://shiawassee.net/county-treasurer/foreclosures/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Foreclosure Information</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>All auctions are held online at <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read Auction Details</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s important to understand the auction process, including bidding phases and payment requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office for Inquiries</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> 989.743.2224</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:jsorenson@shiawassee.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">jsorenson@shiawassee.net</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-summary-of-important-details\">Summary of Important Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Shiawassee-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18316 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Shiawassee County Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-auction-process-in-shiawassee-county\">Auction Process in Shiawassee County</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register Online:</strong> Set up an account on the auction site and place a $1,000 hold on your credit card.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidding Phases:</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Advance Bidding:</strong> Starts 30 days before the auction, where you can place and adjust bids without seeing others.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Active Bidding:</strong> Begins at 10:00 a.m. on auction day, where you can see and raise the current highest bid until 7:00 p.m.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Winning the Auction:</strong> The highest bidder gets the property and will receive an email with payment and paperwork instructions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pro-tips\">Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Homework:</strong> Always research properties thoroughly before bidding. This includes looking into potential liens, property conditions, and market value.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Budget Wisely:</strong> Consider the total costs, including the bid amount, a 10% buyer’s premium, the current year’s taxes, and a $30 deed recording fee.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Useful Links</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://shiawassee.net/county-treasurer/foreclosures/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://shiawassee.net/county-treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Shiawassee County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>FAQs</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>What happens if I win the bid but fail to pay?</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The auction will charge your $1,000 credit card hold, and you may face a ban from future auctions.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Can I inspect the properties before bidding?</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Properties sell &#8220;as-is,&#8221; and unauthorized entry can result in legal issues.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>How do I handle properties with occupants?</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You will need to follow formal eviction processes for any occupied properties.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Need a Hand?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for more detailed guidance on tax deed investing? Feel free to <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">reach out</mark></a> for a consultation or check out our <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free resources</mark></a>. Let&#8217;s get you started on your investing journey!</p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}